### Pull request previews

Each pull request that is open, not a draft and not from a bot gets its own Cloudflare Worker, `{{ slug | replace('.', '-') | replace('_', '-') }}-pr-<number>`, deployed from the same `wrangler.jsonc` under that name and deleted again when the pull request closes or turns draft ([how it works](https://github.com/simonvanlierde/project-templates/blob/main/docs/usage.md#pull-request-previews)).
