## Site

The {{ 'Astro site' if site == 'astro' else 'page' }} in [`site/`]({{ tree }}site) is for the people who use this project. `just site` builds it into `{{ site_out }}/`{% if site == 'astro' %}, from the lockfile that `just site-sync` writes{% endif %}. {% if site_on_workers %}Every push to `main` deploys that build to the Cloudflare Worker `{{ slug | replace('.', '-') | replace('_', '-') }}-site`, configured in [`wrangler.site.jsonc`]({{ blob }}wrangler.site.jsonc){% if site_domain %}, at `{{ site_url }}`{% endif %}.{% if worker %} [`site/worker/index.mjs`]({{ blob }}site/worker/index.mjs) answers `/api/*` in front of the files, and `just site` runs its tests first.{% endif %} The site is public, even when the repo is private.{% else %}Every push to `main` deploys that build to GitHub Pages, at `https://{{ github_user | lower }}.github.io/{{ slug }}/`. A Pages site is public, even when the repo is private.{% endif %}
